    "# HAR CNN Training — Aryan\n",
    "**Run this notebook on Google Colab with GPU (Runtime → Change runtime type → T4 GPU)**\n",
    "\n",
    "What this notebook does:\n",
    "1. Clones the GitHub repo\n",
    "2. Downloads and processes the UCI HAR dataset via Akhil's `data.py`\n",
    "3. Trains the 1-D CNN defined in `src/train_cnn.py`\n",
    "4. Saves `models/cnn.keras` and `results/cnn_metrics.json`\n",
    "5. Downloads the output files so you can commit them from your laptop"
   ]
  },
